00:15:10,520 --> 00:15:11,260
it's one thing.

253
00:15:11,260 --> 00:15:13,220
It's to glorify God.

254
00:15:13,220 --> 00:15:14,720
And how do you glorify God?

255
00:15:15,100 --> 00:15:16,500
By enjoying him forever.

256
00:15:16,500 --> 00:15:18,720
The chief end,

257
00:15:18,720 --> 00:15:22,880
the prime goal

258
00:15:22,880 --> 00:15:25,760
is that we would glorify God

259
00:15:25,760 --> 00:15:26,720
by enjoying him forever.

260
00:15:26,720 --> 00:15:31,280
I had a good friend,

261
00:15:31,280 --> 00:15:32,120
good mentor,

262
00:15:32,120 --> 00:15:33,380
professor,

263
00:15:33,380 --> 00:15:36,440
