270
00:15:47,700 --> 00:15:50,820
It calls us to die to selfishness.

271
00:15:50,820 --> 00:15:53,100
God's nuts about yourself.

272
00:15:53,100 --> 00:15:56,020
He's nuts about you.

273
00:15:56,020 --> 00:15:57,740
He loves you.

274
00:15:57,740 --> 00:15:58,360
And in fact,

275
00:15:58,360 --> 00:15:59,460
he loves you in a way

276
00:15:59,460 --> 00:16:00,680
