277
00:16:00,680 --> 00:16:01,840
These seasons,

278
00:16:01,840 --> 00:16:02,280
you know,

279
00:16:02,280 --> 00:16:04,800
last week,

280
00:16:04,800 --> 00:16:07,300
I talked about a really hard time.

281
00:16:07,300 --> 00:16:09,960
And if you've walked through it,

282
00:16:09,960 --> 00:16:11,200
you know that

283
00:16:11,200 --> 00:16:13,180
