284
00:16:13,920 --> 00:16:15,920
And yet,

285
00:16:15,920 --> 00:16:16,640
even that,

286
00:16:16,640 --> 00:16:19,580
even that,

287
00:16:19,580 --> 00:16:22,060
God intended

288
00:16:22,060 --> 00:16:24,360
