290
00:16:25,940 --> 00:16:28,460
to bring about joy.

291
00:16:28,460 --> 00:16:32,120
Maybe not in the moment.

292
00:16:32,120 --> 00:16:36,680
We'll get into that a little farther.

293
00:16:37,440 --> 00:16:37,620
So,

294
00:16:37,620 --> 00:16:39,220
in my writing,

295
00:16:39,220 --> 00:16:41,340
I've passed it out

296
00:16:41,340 --> 00:16:42,060
to a lot of people

297
00:16:42,060 --> 00:16:44,320
that I tell them,

298
00:16:44,320 --> 00:16:45,580
please tell me what's wrong with it.

299
00:16:45,580 --> 00:16:47,900
And then I quote the verse

300
00:16:47,900 --> 00:16:48,260
where, you know,

301
00:16:48,260 --> 00:16:49,160
the wounds of a friend

302
00:16:49,160 --> 00:16:50,600
being a good thing.

303
00:16:50,600 --> 00:16:51,680
And,

304
00:16:51,680 --> 00:16:52,580
darn it,

305
00:16:52,580 --> 00:16:53,520
they take me up on it.

306
00:16:53,520 --> 00:16:54,000
You know?

307
00:16:54,000 --> 00:16:55,700
They tell me,

308
00:16:55,700 --> 00:16:56,540
what's all wrong with it?

309
00:16:56,540 --> 00:16:57,240
But, I mean,

310
00:16:57,240 --> 00:16:58,180
it's been a great journey.

311
00:16:59,020 --> 00:17:00,520
But one of the statements

312
00:17:00,520 --> 00:17:02,520
that a guy that I really respect,

313
00:17:02,520 --> 00:17:03,320
I really love,

314
00:17:03,320 --> 00:17:04,860
he's all in for Jesus.

315
00:17:04,860 --> 00:17:05,220
He's,

316
00:17:05,220 --> 00:17:06,100
all of his life,

317
00:17:06,100 --> 00:17:07,180
he's been all in for Jesus.

318
00:17:07,180 --> 00:17:08,160
And,

319
00:17:08,160 --> 00:17:09,840
and I admitted in my paper

320
00:17:09,840 --> 00:17:11,300
that I didn't understand something,

321
00:17:11,300 --> 00:17:12,520
but I was sharing it.

322
00:17:12,520 --> 00:17:13,320
And he goes,

323
00:17:13,320 --> 00:17:13,520
yeah,

324
00:17:13,520 --> 00:17:14,260
I don't get that either.

325
00:17:14,260 --> 00:17:15,400
That makes no sense at all.

326
00:17:15,400 --> 00:17:16,420
So,

327
00:17:16,420 --> 00:17:17,240
last week,

328
00:17:17,240 --> 00:17:17,900
I talked about

329
00:17:17,900 --> 00:17:18,840
Bernard of Cliveau

330
00:17:18,840 --> 00:17:20,780
and his four levels of love.

331
00:17:20,780 --> 00:17:23,140
Some of you may remember.

332
00:17:23,140 --> 00:17:24,320
Some of you may have been,

333
00:17:24,360 --> 00:17:25,200
like in Hawaii,

334
00:17:25,200 --> 00:17:25,820
in your mind,

335
00:17:25,820 --> 00:17:26,400
I get that.

336
00:17:26,400 --> 00:17:27,700
But,

337
00:17:27,700 --> 00:17:28,940
I had a friend who was,

338
00:17:28,940 --> 00:17:29,880
actually,

339
00:17:29,880 --> 00:17:31,000
the guy who led me to the Lord.

340
00:17:31,000 --> 00:17:32,660
I was preaching one time,

341
00:17:32,660 --> 00:17:34,340
and he's this tall,

342
00:17:34,340 --> 00:17:36,640
big Italian guy

343
00:17:36,640 --> 00:17:37,760
