344
00:17:37,760 --> 00:17:39,360
And while I was preaching,

345
00:17:39,360 --> 00:17:40,760
he was like glaring at me.

346
00:17:40,760 --> 00:17:41,800
And I'm thinking,

347
00:17:41,800 --> 00:17:42,640
I don't know what I did

348
00:17:42,640 --> 00:17:43,360
to offend Mark,

349
00:17:43,360 --> 00:17:43,880
but, you know,

350
00:17:43,880 --> 00:17:44,480
it's true.

351
00:17:44,480 --> 00:17:44,760
I'm gonna,

352
00:17:44,760 --> 00:17:45,860
and when I finished,

353
00:17:45,860 --> 00:17:46,540
afterwards,

354
00:17:46,540 --> 00:17:46,840
I said,

355
00:17:46,840 --> 00:17:47,040
Mark,

356
00:17:47,040 --> 00:17:47,620
I don't know what I said

357
00:17:47,620 --> 00:17:48,020
to offend you.

358
00:17:48,020 --> 00:17:48,140
He goes,

359
00:17:48,140 --> 00:17:48,340
no,

360
00:17:48,340 --> 00:17:49,620
that was great,

361
00:17:49,620 --> 00:17:49,780
man,

362
00:17:49,780 --> 00:17:50,580
I was paying attention.

363
00:17:50,580 --> 00:17:52,020
And I realized

364
00:17:52,020 --> 00:17:52,720
all the other times

365
00:17:52,720 --> 00:17:53,020
he was,

366
00:17:53,020 --> 00:17:53,840
dum dum dum dum dum.

367
00:17:55,260 --> 00:17:57,120
So glares are sometimes good.

368
00:17:57,120 --> 00:17:58,880
With these lights,

369
00:17:58,880 --> 00:17:59,540
I have no idea

370
00:17:59,540 --> 00:18:00,600
if you're glaring at me or not,

371
00:18:00,600 --> 00:18:02,040
so that's even better.

372
00:18:02,040 --> 00:18:04,220
Bernardo Cliveau said

373
00:18:04,220 --> 00:18:05,260
that we start with,

374
00:18:05,260 --> 00:18:07,060
we love ourself for ourself,

375
00:18:07,060 --> 00:18:09,180
and that's the unregenerate person.

376
00:18:09,180 --> 00:18:11,380
And at some point,

377
00:18:11,380 --> 00:18:12,380
we grow,

378
00:18:12,380 --> 00:18:14,640
