379
00:18:14,640 --> 00:18:15,520
for ourself.

380
00:18:15,520 --> 00:18:18,900
And that's the season of delight

381
00:18:18,900 --> 00:18:20,540
that many of us enter into

382
00:18:20,540 --> 00:18:21,660
when we first get saved.

383
00:18:21,660 --> 00:18:22,360
You know,

384
00:18:22,400 --> 00:18:23,180
I became a Christian

385
00:18:23,180 --> 00:18:25,440
because I've come to give you life

386
00:18:25,440 --> 00:18:26,280
and that more abundantly.

387
00:18:26,280 --> 00:18:26,940
I wanted everything

388
00:18:26,940 --> 00:18:27,680
