389
00:18:27,680 --> 00:18:29,180
I wanted the best of life.

390
00:18:29,180 --> 00:18:30,640
I wanted all that God had for me.

391
00:18:30,640 --> 00:18:31,400
And so I thought,

392
00:18:31,400 --> 00:18:31,580
oh,

393
00:18:31,580 --> 00:18:31,840
okay,

394
00:18:31,840 --> 00:18:32,260
I'll love him.

395
00:18:32,260 --> 00:18:34,360
And it was honestly

396
00:18:34,360 --> 00:18:35,720
