408
00:18:49,120 --> 00:18:49,980
And hopefully,

409
00:18:49,980 --> 00:18:51,400
as you help them

410
00:18:51,400 --> 00:18:52,420
take the things

411
00:18:52,420 --> 00:18:53,380
that you give externally

412
00:18:53,380 --> 00:18:54,640
and they internalize it,

413
00:18:54,640 --> 00:18:55,280
they do it because

414
00:18:55,280 --> 00:18:56,360
of the character development

415
00:18:56,360 --> 00:18:57,920
that's being birthed

416
00:18:57,920 --> 00:18:58,840
inside of them.

417
00:18:58,840 --> 00:19:00,340
That's the hopeful piece.

418
00:19:00,340 --> 00:19:01,680
So I think it's fine

419
00:19:01,680 --> 00:19:02,940
that God starts with us

420
00:19:02,940 --> 00:19:04,040
loving him,

421
00:19:04,040 --> 00:19:04,820
knowing that it's going

422
00:19:04,820 --> 00:19:05,600
to benefit me.

423
00:19:05,600 --> 00:19:07,140
But that at some point,

424
00:19:07,140 --> 00:19:08,340
and this was the point

425
00:19:08,340 --> 00:19:09,700
of the desert

426
00:19:09,700 --> 00:19:10,460
and the point

427
00:19:10,460 --> 00:19:11,160
