432
00:19:18,420 --> 00:19:20,300
I saw that as the pinnacle.

433
00:19:20,300 --> 00:19:22,980
That I want to be like Job.

434
00:19:22,980 --> 00:19:23,600
Now, I don't want

435
00:19:23,600 --> 00:19:24,160
to be like Job,

436
00:19:24,160 --> 00:19:25,680
