483
00:20:45,320 --> 00:20:46,660
and do it.

484
00:20:46,660 --> 00:20:48,600
Because what the world needs

485
00:20:48,600 --> 00:20:50,100
is people who've come alive.

486
00:20:54,600 --> 00:20:55,940
1 Peter 1.8.

487
00:20:55,940 --> 00:20:58,780
To scattered Jewish believers

488
00:20:58,780 --> 00:21:00,420
struggling in a pagan world.

489
00:21:00,420 --> 00:21:02,400
To people who he describes

490
00:21:02,400 --> 00:21:03,180
