492
00:21:04,140 --> 00:21:05,440
and all kinds of trials.

493
00:21:05,440 --> 00:21:06,920
A tough time,

494
00:21:06,920 --> 00:21:08,360
a tough group of people

495
00:21:08,360 --> 00:21:08,920
struggling

496
00:21:08,920 --> 00:21:12,220
out in their diaspora,

497
00:21:12,220 --> 00:21:13,140
their dispersion.

498
00:21:13,140 --> 00:21:14,560
He says,

499
00:21:14,560 --> 00:21:16,460
though you do not see him now,

500
00:21:16,460 --> 00:21:17,940
you believe in him

501
00:21:17,940 --> 00:21:19,060
and are filled

502
00:21:19,060 --> 00:21:20,500
with an inexpressible

503
00:21:20,500 --> 00:21:21,880
and glorious joy.

504
00:21:21,880 --> 00:21:25,160
So,

505
00:21:25,160 --> 00:21:26,240
I'm going to ask the question.

506
00:21:26,240 --> 00:21:27,020
You don't have to answer.

507
00:21:27,020 --> 00:21:28,280
But,

508
00:21:28,280 --> 00:21:29,940
if you want to,

509
00:21:29,940 --> 00:21:30,580
