519
00:21:44,600 --> 00:21:44,900
Yes,

520
00:21:44,900 --> 00:21:45,320
I will.

521
00:21:45,960 --> 00:21:46,340
So,

522
00:21:46,340 --> 00:21:47,680
get on his lap

523
00:21:47,680 --> 00:21:48,520
