525
00:21:49,580 --> 00:21:51,780
Are there some things

526
00:21:51,780 --> 00:21:53,040
in your parents'

527
00:21:53,040 --> 00:21:54,600
upbringing of you

528
00:21:54,600 --> 00:21:57,180
that created a commitment

529
00:21:57,180 --> 00:21:57,740
in you

530
00:21:57,740 --> 00:21:59,160
to not repeat that

531
00:21:59,160 --> 00:21:59,920
in your kids?

532
00:21:59,920 --> 00:22:03,040
And,

533
00:22:03,040 --> 00:22:05,080
and in doing that,

534
00:22:05,080 --> 00:22:06,340
are you now seeing

535
00:22:06,340 --> 00:22:08,040
some of the fruit

536
00:22:08,040 --> 00:22:10,460
of not doing that?

537
00:22:15,080 --> 00:22:16,480
I didn't like it

538
00:22:16,480 --> 00:22:17,600
when I went through it.

539
00:22:17,600 --> 00:22:18,900
But,

540
00:22:18,900 --> 00:22:19,580
I'm so glad

541
00:22:19,580 --> 00:22:20,120
for the fruit

542
00:22:20,120 --> 00:22:21,180
that it produced in me

543
00:22:21,180 --> 00:22:22,120
that I could then

544
00:22:22,120 --> 00:22:22,580
