545
00:22:22,580 --> 00:22:23,680
in the children

546
00:22:23,680 --> 00:22:24,500
that God asked me

547
00:22:24,500 --> 00:22:24,960
to steward.

548
00:22:24,960 --> 00:22:28,620
There is this,

549
00:22:28,620 --> 00:22:30,320
this connection.

550
00:22:30,320 --> 00:22:32,120
And,

551
00:22:32,120 --> 00:22:33,140
the goal is,

552
00:22:33,140 --> 00:22:34,900
is fruit that remains.

553
00:22:34,900 --> 00:22:37,560
Filled,

554
00:22:37,560 --> 00:22:38,020
my,

555
00:22:38,020 --> 00:22:38,820
